# {{lb|en|transitive}} To [[earn]], to [[gain]] (money, points, membership or status).
#: {{ux|en|They hope to '''make''' a bigger profit.}}
#: {{ux|en|He didn't '''make''' the choir after his voice changed.}}
#: {{ux|en|She '''made''' ten points in that game.}}
