#* {{RQ:Shakespeare Merry Wives|I|iv|passage=a scurvy, jack-a-nape priest to meddle or '''make'''}}
# {{lb|en|obsolete}} To increase; to augment; to accrue.
# {{lb|en|obsolete}} To be engaged or concerned in.
