From {{inh|en|enm|make|id=equal}}, {{m|enm|imake}}, {{m|enm|ȝemace}}, from {{inh|en|ang|ġemaca|t=a mate, an equal, companion, peer}}, from {{inh|en|gmw-pro|*gamakō}}, from {{inh|en|gem-pro|*gamakô|t=companion, comrade}}, from {{der|en|ine-pro|*maǵ-|t=to knead, oil}}. Reinforced by {{cog|non|maki|t=an equal}}.

Cognate with {{cog|is|maki||spouse}}, {{cog|sv|make||spouse, husband}}, {{cog|da|mage||companion, fellow, mate}}. {{doublet|en|match}}.

